---
/**
 * Shown on testnet portal and registration pages.
 * Keep wording in sync with docs/TESTNET.md (Part 3), docs/BOING-TOKENOMICS-AND-INCENTIVIZED-TESTNET.md,
 * and docs/TESTNET-VALIDATOR-GUIDE.md.
 */
---
<aside class="incentive-notice" role="note" aria-label="Testnet Passport status">
  <p class="incentive-notice__lead">
    <strong>Testnet Passport is live.</strong>
    Public testnet <strong>6913</strong> is open. Verified quests, building, and validator activity are
    recorded in your Testnet Passport and <strong>may be considered</strong> for any future program.
    This is <strong>not</strong> a promise of tokens, an airdrop, or a mainnet BOING claim.
  </p>
  <p class="incentive-notice__more">
    Rules are versioned and public: <a href="/testnet/passport/rules-v1.json">Passport rules v1</a>.
    Activity since genesis counts once you register.
    Plain-language overview:
    <a href="/pdfs/BOING-TOKENOMICS-AND-INCENTIVIZED-TESTNET.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tokenomics &amp; testnet (PDF)</a>.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .incentive-notice {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35));
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-teal, #22d3ee);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.08));
    color: var(--text-secondary, inherit);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .incentive-notice__lead { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
  .incentive-notice__more { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .incentive-notice strong { color: var(--text-primary, inherit); }
  .incentive-notice a { color: var(--accent-teal, #22d3ee); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
